{"answer":null,"company_tags":[],"concept_id":"kv-fp8-e4m3-vs-e5m2-format","content_sha256":"sha256:dbe4af755e65821e12237a51f8b598ce980364106fc59632ceba6bc81f69c9c9","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789955478.60541,"domain":"llm-inference","explanation":"FP8 两格式位宽都是 8bit:E4M3(4 指数/3 尾数)范围小精度高,E5M2(5 指数/2 尾数)范围大精度低。KV 值经缩放后范围可控,常用 E4M3 保精度;两者均可用于 KV,需搭配 scale。","id":"q-infer-mag2-kv-fp8-e4m3-e5m2-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"E4M3 尾数多、动态范围小,精度更高,适合数值范围受控且做了缩放的 KV;E5M2 指数多、动态范围大但尾数少、精度低。KV 量化通常偏好 E4M3 并配合 per-tensor/较细粒度缩放"},{"id":"b","text":"E5M2 精度更高,恒优于 E4M3"},{"id":"c","text":"两者位宽不同,E4M3 是 16bit"},{"id":"d","text":"FP8 KV 只能用 E5M2,E4M3 仅用于权重"}],"prompt":"KV cache 采用 FP8 时,E4M3 与 E5M2 两种格式如何取舍?","review_state":null,"schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"tradeoff","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"FP8 formats (NVIDIA/Arm/Intel)","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2209.05433"},{"kind":"official_docs","title":"vLLM FP8 KV cache","url":"https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/features/quantization/"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"quantization","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
